mlvio: third-party notices

The MLV container layout, block field names and constants are facts about the
Magic Lantern Video file format, documented in Magic Lantern's `mlv.h` and
`raw.h` and on the Magic Lantern wiki. No Magic Lantern or MLV-App source code
(GPL) is included in this crate; those projects were consulted only as
behavioural references.

src/decode/lj92.rs
    Lossless JPEG decoder derived from liblj92 by Andrew Baldwin
    (https://bitbucket.org/baldand/mlrawviewer, MIT) via the Rust
    translation in the `libmlv` crate by Ilia Sibiryakov (offered under MIT).
    Copyright (c) 2014 Andrew Baldwin, (c) 2024 Ilia Sibiryakov.
    Substantially rewritten for bounds safety and multi-table support; the
    original MIT notice is retained in the file.

src/decode/unpack.rs
    Bit layouts follow the `raw_pixblock` bitfield description in Magic
    Lantern's `raw.h` (format fact). Implementation written independently.
